# c optimize's find engine used to floor its CPU deadline at 60 s, so a
# small budget did not bound it.  The bridge now passes eng_left() (with a
# 0.5 s floor) to find_cands.  Timing is not part of a golden; this records
# that the small-budget run still finishes with an honest, stable result.
c optimize budget 2 nofile engines find
```c
int f(int x) { int i = x; return i++ * i++; }
```
